# Print Slicer Settings

| Setting | TPU (Grip) | PETG (Structure) |
|--------|------------|------------------|
| Nozzle Temperature | 220 °C | 250 °C |
| Bed Temperature | 40 °C | 70 °C |
| Layer Height | 0.2 mm | 0.2 mm |
| First Layer Height | 0.2 mm | 0.2 mm |
| Infill Type | Gyroid | Grid |
| Infill Percent | 100% | 100% |
| Support Material | None | None |

\*Creality Print 7.0 Slicer

